  "improvements": [
    "Shoteria and Dristor use source-backed frontage signs. Shoteria's invented terrace was removed because its OSM outdoor_seating=no tag does not permit it; the real building stayed in place.",
    "Terraces now require a positive outdoor-seating source; source buildings, partial strips and courtyards remain represented.",
    "The existing three-step animated Noroc and shaorma participation, 44px controls and cancellation safeguards are preserved."
  ],
  "remainingGaps": [
    "The native Lipscani plaque endpoint faces a timber facade at close range; the public plaque sight line and local collision need physical inspection.",
    "Carusel levels and the Curtea Veche history handler still require participation and legitimate-access review; source-backed interiors must not be inferred from an exterior footprint.",
    "Large numbers of unmeasured neighbouring heights, facade details and roof colours remain estimates; the source consumer pass does not prove their visual accuracy.",
    "One degenerate mesh, six phantom findings and substantial physical z-fighting remain.",
    "Raw audit findings remain for physical review: badGeometry 1, zfight 152, phantom 6."
  ],
